OL,3,AHow the Jensen Huang scandal created a
OL,4,Aheadache for business-friendly
OL,5,ASingapore
OL,6,
OL,7,FA major scandal involving Nvidia
OL,8,Ffounder Jensen Huang and a suspected
OL,9,FChinese spy based in Singapore has cast
OL,10,Fa spotlight on the city-state's success
OL,11,Fas a global chip hub - and a location
OL,12,Ffor alleged illicit trade.
OL,14,FOn Thursday, Huang stepped down from
OL,15,Fthe US chip giant after admitting he
OL,16,Fhad an affair. He was reportedly
OL,17,Finvolved with a woman named Alice
OL,18,FHuang, who ran Singaporean data centre
OL,19,Fcompany Megaspeed, a major buyer of
OL,20,FNvidia's chips.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/18
