OL,3,AMicrosoft outage 'stark reminder' of
OL,4,Ahow much we rely on tech
OL,5,
OL,6,FA critical Microsoft outage lasting
OL,7,Fmore than 22 hours has raised questions
OL,8,Fabout how heavily vital services rely
OL,9,Fon a handful of major tech firms.
OL,11,FThe disruption, which affected
OL,12,FMicrosoft 365 services such as Outlook,
OL,13,Fwas caused by routine automated checks
OL,14,Fthat took some servers offline,
OL,15,Foverloading the remaining ones with
OL,16,Ftraffic.
OL,18,FThe recovery took nearly a full day
OL,19,Fwhile engineers gradually restored
OL,20,Fservices, highlighting how embedded the
OL,21,Ftech giant's services are in modern
OL,22,Fsociety.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/18
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
