OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1794613695
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AMicrosoft 'deeply sorry' for global
OL,4,Aoutage after almost 24 hours of
OL,5,Adisruption
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe outage hit more than 70 countries,
OL,8,Fdisrupting everything from business
OL,9,Foperations to government services and
OL,10,Fpersonal users. More than 430 million
OL,11,Fpeople use the affected products
OL,12,Fworldwide.
OL,14,FMicrosoft said it was a technical issue
OL,15,Fintroduced during a "network capacity
OL,16,Fupgrade" and not related to cyber or
OL,17,Fartificial intelligence agents.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/18
